{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0226_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0226_story_02_synopsis", "source_sha256": "7d095633b938ea5c576a0243d4543adbf1bd6d48adcfa0f413371e741161d7cb", "ja": "レッスン後、百合子の選んだラブコメ作品を\n物色し『セカキュー』こと『世界樹にて君と\n悠久を結ぶ』という乙女ゲーを遊ぶことに。\n朋花が王子に振り回されたり美奈子が背負投\nしたりして、次第にゲームにハマっていく。", "zh": "课程结束后，大家翻看百合子挑选的恋爱喜剧作品，决定玩一款名为《与君在世界树下缔结悠久羁绊》的乙女游戏，简称“世树Q”。朋花被王子折腾得团团转，美奈子使出过肩摔，大家也渐渐沉迷于游戏之中。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0226_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0226_story_02_1000_p", "source_sha256": "ab7caa024d16e20ced3e27302e0045d9811e7762aca75dc86e149576ab94fe2d", "ja": "（LOVERS HEARTが本格始動！\nレッスンを覗いてるが……うん、悪くないぞ！）", "zh": "（LOVERS HEART正式启动！\n我去看了看她们的练习……嗯，不错！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0226_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0226_story_02_1001_005yay", "source_sha256": "d07e1380c5eca8021a40a574b103b1bb31a6ed4fab34db1f9dbc87ca0ae4cee6", "ja": "通しでダンスやってみましたけど……\nどうでしたか、{$P$}？", "zh": "我们把整段舞蹈跳了一遍……感觉怎么样，{$P$}？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0226_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0226_story_02_1002_p", "source_sha256": "91031e07bbc8b1afedf60a9ec793c802495f9bf808de514b6080092054cfa91f", "ja": "ああ、初めてでこれなら上出来だと思う！\nスケジュールは順調に行きそうだな。", "zh": "啊，第一次就能做到这样，我觉得已经很不错了！\n看来日程能顺利进行下去。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0226_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0226_story_02_1003_019min", "source_sha256": "4cba407540c568cc47a61ccf3bac1a6c5e2c18fcb88e26a4aaf0e05cf0140e34", "ja": "わっほ～い！　じゃあレッスン終了という事で……\n桃まん蒸かしてきたから、腹ペコさんからどうぞ♪", "zh": "哇～呼！那么练习就到这里告一段落……\n我蒸了寿桃包，肚子饿了的请自便哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0226_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0226_story_02_1004_005yay", "source_sha256": "65fde1525270a4b8de48e58115f11e74488fc3b03fe2b0c8636d597f602a325b", "ja": "わあ、ふかふかしてて、すっごくおいしそうです！\nいただきまーす！", "zh": "哇，松松软软的，看起来好好吃哦！\n我开动啦——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0226_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0226_story_02_1005_p", "source_sha256": "f1706a8df4f805673bd9f7aa05838d22c7ddd0a73ad6b7fd932a2ce335ae9c27", "ja": "百合子もダンスが苦手なはずなのに、\nちゃんとついていけてるな。やるじゃないか！", "zh": "百合子明明也不擅长跳舞，却能跟上节奏。真不错！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0226_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0226_story_02_1006_026yur", "source_sha256": "71458b65dcaf8003a5bd190a12acfde4b614ff666bccffa764e77adf460f9280", "ja": "実は、苦手なところを、美奈子さんに付き合って\nもらって練習していて……そのおかげです！", "zh": "其实是我不擅长的地方，都拜托美奈子\n陪我一起练习了……这多亏了她！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0226_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0226_story_02_1007_031tom", "source_sha256": "0cd8b7e10d5a49d70e9049d1c01854063df1dd5a72b667c9d13d29dfccc10348", "ja": "美奈子さんは真面目ですし、気配りも上手で……\n私達も、安心してレッスンに取り組めますね～。", "zh": "美奈子很认真，也很会照顾人……我们也能放心地投入练习了呢～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0226_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0226_story_02_1008_019min", "source_sha256": "bdb8cfcf78e611f98746b86de66b0124bb5a97065aacbdc8cb611127f68bbab4", "ja": "えへへ、この中じゃ一番年上だからね！\nおかわりの桃まんも、ごま団子もあるよ～♪", "zh": "嘿嘿，因为我是这里年纪最大的嘛！\n还有追加的桃馒头和芝麻团子哦～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0226_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0226_story_02_1009_005yay", "source_sha256": "1dfc80fe282b6ebe164b7689298f1e3fe8ad83bb571ffa53cb0c68fce24d5435", "ja": "は～い♪　あ、でもダンスは平気でも、\n歌はやっぱり不安があるかも……。", "zh": "好～的♪　啊，不过跳舞倒是没问题，\n唱歌果然还是会有点不安……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0226_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0226_story_02_1010_005yay", "source_sha256": "85f3db8528b8211bb9ad4d71230861437a373cf9def4fbdd114322a248850923", "ja": "歌の先生に「ちょっと元気すぎる」って言われて、\n今回の曲の『切ない』とは反対なのかも～。", "zh": "唱歌老师说我“有点太有精神了”，可能和这次歌曲的“伤感”正好相反吧～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0226_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0226_story_02_1011_p", "source_sha256": "e29e0551955719df34e571c0e0a6b56846b8c6d0ac372298f76b1cce9df9e248", "ja": "なるほどな……。でも、それは\nこの後の勉強会で学べばいい話だよ。", "zh": "原来如此……不过，这些内容在接下来的学习会上学会就行了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0226_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0226_story_02_1012_026yur", "source_sha256": "1cb82c0e77e40adc48c4fbfe1a909b7d23d242fdd87e8b85b1ea7f6b39c1aad0", "ja": "そうですね！　着替えたら、みんなで、\n二次元のキャラクターと恋をしにいきましょう！", "zh": "没错！换好衣服后，我们大家一起去和二次元角色谈恋爱吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0226_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0226_story_02_1013_026yur", "source_sha256": "10ab6dcc76e062866dacd269ed355de5a67213e8aec09572ecb4b8181bb8d9f0", "ja": "よいしょっと……これが私の用意した資料です！\n恋愛、ラブコメ系を主に集めてきました！", "zh": "好嘞……这就是我准备的资料！\n我主要收集了恋爱、恋爱喜剧类的作品！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0226_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0226_story_02_1014_031tom", "source_sha256": "fe26f58f7211280498dba5273162206c22ae319112788d928bddc0ee38dd74f9", "ja": "ゲームだけでなく、漫画やライトノベルも……。\nこんなに数があるものなんですね～。", "zh": "不只是游戏，还有漫画和轻小说……原来有这么多种类啊～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0226_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0226_story_02_1015_026yur", "source_sha256": "ead2eee1b338b46ed5bb2fc35151db04b71960ea4f6986f3c16a4e4f8c66284b", "ja": "ラブコメは大人気ジャンルですから。\nバリエーションがすごく豊富なんです！", "zh": "恋爱喜剧可是超人气的类型。\n所以种类特别丰富！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0226_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0226_story_02_1016_026yur", "source_sha256": "6d614f3c5ff8f307aac827261829841c590e2fbf871d30431714d7875de70bee", "ja": "女の子主人公だったり、異世界に行ったり、ハーレム系\nだったり……必ず好みの作品が見つかるはずですよ♪", "zh": "有女主角视角的、有穿越到异世界的、也有后宫向的\n……一定会找到你喜欢的作品哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0226_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0226_story_02_1017_005yay", "source_sha256": "3e0c9b8439703d2ac70547b971adaa92b009c3014f0589a924f44228fa400e87", "ja": "表紙のキャラクター、とってもかわいいです！\nでも、中身は小説みたい……？", "zh": "封面上的角色，好可爱呀！\n不过，里面好像是小说……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0226_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0226_story_02_1018_026yur", "source_sha256": "27b3e713b6fa5f951f456b66cf102529bd0be81129394b270f4f8a435a371201", "ja": "あ、その作品はコミカライズされているので、\n漫画で同じ内容を楽しめますよ。これです！", "zh": "啊，因为那部作品已经被改编成漫画了，\n所以可以通过漫画欣赏相同的内容哦。就是这本！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0226_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0226_story_02_1019_005yay", "source_sha256": "cf588351c123d5fefdffeb0b42ac79d0151859e2396eeea49441ba98d48732e7", "ja": "わあ、ありがとうございます！\n漫画で読んでみますー！", "zh": "哇，谢谢你！\n我去看漫画版——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0226_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0226_story_02_1020_019min", "source_sha256": "94393141208152d79f4baec1cfcc62463918345dc34d158e39fa9c35df2b3415", "ja": "この『セカキュー』って、ゲームショップで見た\nことある！　確かすごい人気シリーズなんだよね～。", "zh": "这本《世界树迷宫》，我在游戏店里见过！我记得是非常有人气的系列作品吧～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0226_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0226_story_02_1021_019min", "source_sha256": "e46c14f91c406d05c22af2400593d1c09e9efbf8f9904d7ca6f051daa55a322e", "ja": "異世界に飛ばされた女の子が、イケメンの\n騎士たちと世界を救うとかなんとか……。", "zh": "听说是被传送到异世界的女孩，和帅气的骑士们一起拯救世界什么的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0226_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0226_story_02_1022_026yur", "source_sha256": "92f681766bdd94c5cce8a7ccdce9422e7161bf1871281592c0ddd3f8a06387a7", "ja": "『世界樹にて君と悠久を結ぶ』、略して『セカキュー』\nですね！　押しも押されもせぬ名作です！", "zh": "《在世界树与你结下永恒》，简称《世结》！没错！这可是当之无愧的名作！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0226_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0226_story_02_1023_026yur", "source_sha256": "2d315dd095a302eac7f12c858a709269ccb9bb1369626084fd983f8dec81a95a", "ja": "ただ、戦闘パートが結構、歯応えがあって……\n私も全ルート回収は出来てないんです……。", "zh": "不过，战斗部分相当有挑战性……我也还没能跑完所有路线……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0226_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0226_story_02_1024_019min", "source_sha256": "668eb0559d867c5a519ef14d31a670e881f8698beae94a96713d6c7f5b4dc89c", "ja": "へえ……難しい方が面白そうだし、\n私はこれやってみようかな！", "zh": "诶……难一点好像更有意思，\n那我就试试这个吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0226_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0226_story_02_1025_p", "source_sha256": "c9d69dbfc3d5b7796d0c91d524ea8b6b1cd569067d571139e9fdb1577531bb76", "ja": "（いわゆる乙女ゲーというやつか……。\nせっかくの機会だし、隣で見学させてもらおう！）", "zh": "（所谓的乙女游戏吗……难得有这样的机会，就让我在旁边观摩一下吧！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0226_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0226_story_02_1026_019min", "source_sha256": "ffff8e829b2e8025ee648672435a413a4b1d506461d9c8efdea22664b0f7ae37", "ja": "この王子様、よく話しかけてくるなぁ。私としては、\n恰幅のいい騎士団長の方が好みなんだけど……。", "zh": "这位王子还真是经常来搭话啊。要说我的喜好，  \n我更喜欢身材魁梧的骑士团长，不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0226_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0226_story_02_1027_gomannaouji", "source_sha256": "ecc9d8f21daebc0f34706bacda371fbbdefe17e62f48ee40072eb327a069cd2f", "ja": "「ふん、民などただの礎。手となり足となり、\nただ俺のために尽くせばいい」", "zh": "「哼，民众不过是垫脚石。化为我的手足，\n只要全心全意为我效力即可」", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0226_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0226_story_02_1028_031tom", "source_sha256": "caabe900a26680b35c61a29fd4ae9a266b88aa0a37a147d8eadda677c3db0c1a", "ja": "感心しませんね～。この王子、人の上に\n立つ者の自覚が足りないのでは～？", "zh": "不敢恭维呢～这位王子，似乎还没有意识到自己是站在人们之上的人吧～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0226_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0226_story_02_1029_gomannaouji", "source_sha256": "bc0bbf0706fa999ecfcb13ff3f074ca409d669cdc69373ecc4cbdc598357297b", "ja": "「この国は我が王族の威光あっての発展と平和だ。\n俗物の感傷に付き合う暇はない。去れ」", "zh": "这个国家正是凭借我王族的威光，才得以发展与和平。没工夫陪你这种俗人的多愁善感。滚吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0226_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0226_story_02_1030_031tom", "source_sha256": "4c8dfeadbae50ab95a79281584957cec62aed94d2a387f421d743fd826a39fa2", "ja": "……。わかってきましたね。二次元と三次元の差が\nもどかしい、という気持ちが……。", "zh": "……。我渐渐明白了呢。那种因二次元与三次元的差距\n而感到焦躁的心情……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0226_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0226_story_02_1031_031tom", "source_sha256": "3578606e2c52b457ff2ecc5b0d536b1740ac490d557130cebf65ccce6984a2f1", "ja": "この王子の目の前で、プレッシャーをかけて\n平伏させられないのが、非常に不服です～。", "zh": "在这位王子面前，没法施加压力让人俯首跪拜，实在是非常不满呢～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0226_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0226_story_02_1032_p", "source_sha256": "c751c7235a71bb5218681e0c20f825522da2ade22da9385cf0937622eb1d7e8a", "ja": "お、落ち着け朋花。決してそういう\nもどかしさを学んでほしいわけでは……。", "zh": "喔、冷静点，朋花。我可绝不是想让你学会这种无奈……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0226_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0226_story_02_1033_gomannaouji", "source_sha256": "1ee0668a0ce515ac78242903fa6dc79c6350f72f6f81d370799af8d61cd38914", "ja": "「なにか言いたげだな？　この俺に物申すなら、\n相応の覚悟あってのことだろうな」", "zh": "「你似乎有什么想说的？要是敢对我提意见，\n想必也已经做好了相应的觉悟吧」", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0226_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0226_story_02_1034_031tom", "source_sha256": "6de618b0d4222c7ac6f7bb90cc51c53975798b899d3192ca0b92b3176c6a329f", "ja": "あら、選択肢が出ましたね～。\n『謝る』と『冷静に諭す』と……。", "zh": "哎呀，出现选项了呢～。\n“道歉”和“冷静劝导”还有……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0226_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0226_story_02_1035_019min", "source_sha256": "217c6f12e4fee5e555210413297cb1b4f512957587ed23566b7cd3395137cdb7", "ja": "この音楽がまた焦らせてくるね……。\nええと、これだ！　『背負投する』！", "zh": "这音乐又让人焦急起来了呢……\n呃，就是这个！“过肩摔”！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0226_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0226_story_02_1036_p", "source_sha256": "fc54265c8997ded0768e68e14869862698cf4233ace07da08264d5ca0c3ab9d4", "ja": "えっ！？\n王子様を背負投するのか……？", "zh": "咦！？\n要把王子过肩摔出去吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0226_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0226_story_02_1037_019min", "source_sha256": "7afdb58a2fbad0b77d68c8650eef4b5c9fafd76bc91e612378a7345f75efa02c", "ja": "だ、だって説得は難しそうですし、すごい近づいて\nくるし……あと、投げ間合いだったから……。", "zh": "可、可是说服他好像很难，而且他还一个劲儿地靠近……再说，当时正好在我的投掷距离内……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0226_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0226_story_02_1038_gomannaouji", "source_sha256": "9b78d700ac94bae93c063447f1671ff2793c0067bd7f286f8f75999bcc30c027", "ja": "「……ははっ、この俺を投げ飛ばすとは……。\n……面白い女だ」", "zh": "「……哈哈，居然能把我给摔飞出去……。\n……真是有趣的女人」", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0226_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0226_story_02_1039_019min", "source_sha256": "de973c31674d39e21f31d6ff9e709e6e6e99b296cda96cdef60b12de3f263895", "ja": "あれ……？\nなんか好感度があがっちゃった！？", "zh": "奇怪……？\n好感度怎么反而上升了！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0226_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0226_story_02_1040_031tom", "source_sha256": "d2689336ef26d0caa78ba0ad94d774d4fa5522e6d227e635373ac14c8430412e", "ja": "さすが美奈子さんです～。この調子で威厳と傲慢を\n履き違えた王子を、調教していきましょう～。", "zh": "不愧是美奈子～。就照这个势头，继续调教那个把威严和傲慢混为一谈的王子吧～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0226_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0226_story_02_1041_019min", "source_sha256": "b37e54c542c298f58a467dad282cc28a25dea04d944989fc313ab05386e1aea2", "ja": "う～ん、こんなヘンテコな選択肢で好感度があがる\nなんて……恋愛のゲームって、そういうものなのかな？", "zh": "嗯～居然靠这种奇奇怪怪的选项提升好感度……恋爱游戏都是这样的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0226_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0226_story_02_1042_026yur", "source_sha256": "2c7519aadff3134975b0b45817580820bdeedfe13d8d8e6974180d47aeca000e", "ja": "し、初期でこんなに好感度が高いなんて……！\n最難関の王子様ルート、いけますよ！", "zh": "一、一开始好感度就这么高……！\n最难攻略的王子路线，能走了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0226_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0226_story_02_1043_005yay", "source_sha256": "f64b797ca1da1db2f03ddc2df4805941468484acab0b85db2aca2b91c65f2ec5", "ja": "えっとえっと、私は悩んでる新人騎士さんの\n力にもなってあげたいな～って！", "zh": "那个那个，我想成为烦恼中的新手骑士的助力～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0226_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0226_story_02_1044_p", "source_sha256": "a51a12041a15e9cfc34a687c1c27ca52f5d23600f37d6fc5d5c602890d89cbab", "ja": "（みんな、実は興味があったのかな……？　次元を\n超えても恋は恋、まず夢中になってみないとな！）", "zh": "（大家其实是对此感兴趣的吗……？即使跨越次元，恋爱也还是恋爱，首先得全心投入才行啊！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
